{"product_id":"word-smart-ii-3rd-edition-smart-guides","title":"Word Smart II, 3rd Edition (Smart Guides)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDid you know that…• The word \"noisome\" has nothing whatsoever to do with noise?• \"Ordinance\" and \"ordnance\" have two distinct meanings?• An \"errant\" fool is a fool who is lost, while an \"arrant\" fool is one whose foolishness is obvious?If any of these facts caught you by surprise, then you need Word Smart II. More than one million people improved their vocabulary with the original Word Smart, but an educated and powerful vocabulary doesn’t stop growing with one book! All of the 1,455 words featured in Word Smart II belong in an impressive vocabulary. Learning and using these words effectively can help you get better grades, score higher on tests, and communicate more confidently at work.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 139 x 208\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Princeton Review\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780375765766\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 384\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45380332617881,"sku":"15RB-5-9780375765766","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/681e33d1c0140_Word_Smart_II__3rd_Edition__Smart_Guides__Princeton_Review.jpg?v=1746894875","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/word-smart-ii-3rd-edition-smart-guides","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}